  author = {Marom Bikson and Colleen A. Hanlon and Adam J. Woods and Bernadette T. Gillick and Leigh Elkins Charvet and Claus Lamm and Graziella Madeo and Adrienn Holczer and Jorge Almeida and Andrea Antal and Mohammad Reza Ay and Chris Baeken and Daniel M. Blumberger and Salvatore Campanella and Joan Albert Camprodon and Lasse Christiansen and Colleen K A Loo and Jenny Crinion and Paul Bernard Fitzgerald and Luigi Gallimberti and Peyman Ghobadi‐Azbari and Iman Ghodratitoostani and Roland H. Grabner and Gesa Hartwigsen and Akimasa Hirata and Adam Kirton and Helena Knotková and Evgeny M. Krupitsky and Paola Marangolo and Ester Miyuki Nakamura-Palacios and Weronika Potok and Samir Kumar Praharaj and Christian Carl Ruff and Gottfried Schlaug and Hartwig Roman Siebner and Charlotte Jane Stagg and Axel Thielscher and Nicole Wenderoth and Ti‐Fei Yuan and Xiaochu Zhang and Hamed Ekhtiari},
